      "id": "6dd4eb72-9f02-48c1-a61f-9c853741274a",
      "name": "Data streams",
      "description": {
        "content": "Data stream APIs enable you to manage data streams, which are collections of indices that share the same index template and are managed as a single unit for time-series data.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
